s-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Finlay</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Shop\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Shop</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Illumine Designs</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Price\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Price</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">$500</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Function\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Function</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Set Spawn at Base</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">v1.0.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">January 14th, 2023</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n<i><big>\"Good way to spawn in a specific area on your property!\"</big></i>\n</p><p>The <b>Property Spawn Location</b> is an object that can be purchased from <a href=\"/wiki/Illumine_Designs\" title=\"Illumine Designs\">Illumine Designs</a>. It allows the user to change where they spawn on their property.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>The Property Spawn Location is a gray rectangle with the classic spawn circle on its top face. Once placed, whenever a player respawns, they will respawn at the location of the Property Spawn Location rather than the center of their lot. This can be used to quickly return to one's property by resetting their character. Alternatively, one may choose to use a logic system with a <a href=\"/wiki/Commander\" title=\"Commander\">Commander</a> and an <a href=\"/wiki/Interactor\" title=\"Interactor\">Interactor</a> to effectively teleport oneself back to their property without needing to wait for a respawn.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903163508\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.028 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.037 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 62/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 78/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.005/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019508/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   29.769      1 Template:Objects\n100.00%   29.769      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:405-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260903163508 and revision id 11510. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>","categories":["Structures"],"links":[{"title":"Commander","exists":true},{"title":"Illumine Designs","exists":true},{"title":"Interactor","exists":true}],"images":["Propertyspawnlocation.png","PSL_BOXED.png"]}
